WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:03.550
Due to the Continuous Trap
Endless Emptiness's effect,

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.400
I Special Summon a Level 10-or-above 
monster from my hand.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.530
Witness the infinite power of the Timelords.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:14.490
What?

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.150
Appear, Michion, the Timelord.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.250
Hailon, the Timelord.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.670
Raphion, the Timelord.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.140
Gabrion, the Timelord.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.660
And Sandaion, the Timelord.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.040
No way!

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.380
He instantly summoned five Timelords?

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:44.090
No matter what you do, 
you can't save this city.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.160
Yusei Fudo, that's what 
you will learn.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.780
Due to Endless Emptiness's effect, 
my monster's attack points become 0.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:02.040
Raphion, Gabrion, Hailon, 
Michion and Sandaion

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.680
can't be destroyed by effects or battle, 
and I take 0 battle damage.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:12.650
Yusei Fudo, no matter what you 
do, you cannot save this city.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.380
That's what you will learn.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.900
Michion, the Timelord attacks 
Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.420
It's the first attack!

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.130
What will you do, Yusei?

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.300
He has five Timelords.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:29.430
I can only stop one attack 
with Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.630
Since I don't know Michion's effect,

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.340
there's a chance that 
this attack will defeat me.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.010
Yusei, I am you.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:42.280
I see!

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.410
Not yet!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.980
I won't use Scrap-Iron Scarecrow yet!

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:49.220
Then you'll take Michion, 
the Timelord's effect.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.290
When it battles, your 
life points are halved.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.530
Yusei managed to survive!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:24.020
But he only has 750 life points!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.920
Is he okay?

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.080
This is bad!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.120
Yusei...

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.810
My attack continues.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.610
The second Timelord Hailon attacks.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.870
I flip over my trap card 
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:49.340
It negates your monster's attack!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.950
After it activates, this 
card is set again!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:00.940
When Hailon, the Timelord battles, you take 
damage equal to the difference in our life points.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.320
If you stopped Michion's attack 
with Scrap-Iron Scarecrow,

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.970
you wouldn't have been able
 to stop Hailon's attack and lost.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:12.530
Why didn't you use Scrap-Iron 
Scarecrow at the start?

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.680
You said that you were me.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.560
And I would have bluffed 
with my first monster

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.170
and dealt the finishing blow
with my second monster.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.510
That's why I took Michion's attack 
and saved Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:29.000
No matter what you try, I still have 
three Timelords that can attack.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.980
You think you can survive that?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:36.080
In order to protect Neo Domino 
City, I will definitely survive!

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.170
Bring it on, Z-one!

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.570
Riding Duels.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.700
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:52.310
the people with the legendary marks who 
risked Their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:04:00.350
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:04.890
Is a new legendary duel

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:21.850
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:27.470
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:33.080
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:39.680
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.990
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:50.560
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:58.410
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:03.610
Even if you can't see your destination

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:09.080
Run on your feet without fear

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:14.950
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:22.480
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:41.710
Feelings My Father Left Me

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.680
Yusei, feel the power of the third Timelord.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.100
Raphion, the Timelord attacks.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:55.360
I activate Synchron Believer's 
effect from my hand!

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:59.110
When my Synchro Monster is attacked,

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:03.130
that battle is negated, and I can Special
Summon this card from my hand!

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.330
I Special Summon Synchron Believer 
in defense position!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:13.270
So Raphion, the Timelord's attack is 
negated, and its effect doesn't activate!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.490
Raphion would've returned 
the monster it battled to your hand,

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.480
and you would've taken damage 
equal to its attack points.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.430
So you stopped that too.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:28.570
For the fourth Timelord, Gabrion attacks 
Ancient Fairy Dragon again.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.630
You don't have anything 
left to stop this attack.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:42.100
When Gabrion, the Timelord battles, all 
cards on your field return to your deck.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:43.300
What?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.400
Oh no!

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:47.050
All cards return to his deck?

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.270
That means Yusei can't do anything!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.850
Now your field is empty.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.510
Even your slightest hope 
has turned into nothing.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.480
Sandaion, the Timelord attacks you directly.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:12.520
When Sandaion, the Timelord battles, 
you take 4000 points of damage.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.010
If this succeeds, it's all over!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.720
He can't let it succeed!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.210
He can't!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.910
Give it your all, Yusei!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.380
Yusei!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.850
Yusei!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:47.330
I knew you couldn't save this world.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.890
I'm not done.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.750
It's not over yet!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.810
Power Tool Dragon protected Yusei!

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:04.050
The duel still continues!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.180
Why?

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.690
When Sandion's effect activated,

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:12.360
I activated Synchron Keeper's 
effect from my hand.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.360
When I take damage from an effect, 
that effect is negated,

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.770
and by removing Synchron Keeper and 
a Tuner in my graveyard from play,

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:25.020
I can Special Summon a Synchro Monster 
 whose Level equals their total!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:36.980
I would congratulate you for surviving, 
but you have little time left.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:43.700
Ark Cradle will soon collide with Neo Domino 
City, destroying that detestable Moment.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.130
He's right. There's no time left.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.500
If I don't hurry, everyone will...

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:08.100
Everyone's fate depends on me.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.580
Yusei.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:15.480
You now know how it feels to carry
 the burden of everyone's fate.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.860
It was the same for me.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:23.590
When I failed them, the despair and sadness 
I felt was indescribably huge.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.690
That's why I came to this era!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:31.830
In order to save something, 
something else must be sacrificed!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:37.270
Yusei, you're too arrogant if you think you 
can save both the present and the future!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.500
What?

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.820
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.110
You only have one card in your hand.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.240
What can you do with that?

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:51.600
It's true that I only have one card
 in my hand and Power Tool Dragon.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.800
But on his next turn, his five 
Timelords return to his deck.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.420
And Z-one has zero cards in his hand.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:04.040
If he doesn't draw a Timelord, he won't 
have any Timelords on his field.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.810
I'll have a path to victory!

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:08.400
I can do this!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:13.450
I will get through this turn 
and open the door to victory!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.480
My turn!

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.510
I activate my Continuous Trap.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:23.400
By sending Endless Emptiness to the 
graveyard, I activate Infinite Light.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.950
This card negates the effect

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.190
that causes Timelords to return to the 
deck during the Standby Phase.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.390
What?

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.280
And since Endless Emptiness 
was sent to the graveyard,

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:35.090
there's no longer the effect that
 makes attack points become 0.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.800
Sandaion, the Timelord's 
attack points return to 4000.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:43.570
The Timelords won't leave 
my side for eternity.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:47.540
There is no way you can win.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.010
No way...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.140
It's finally here!

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.280
Whoa!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.200
Ark Cradle collided with a 
Neo Domino City building!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:03.090
This is a very dangerous situation!

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.290
To the roof!

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.600
The city!

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:10.880
My card!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.780
Yusei!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.740
Is this real?

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.210
Yusei!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.090
Yusei!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.240
I've failed?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.060
I can't save anyone?

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.500
Yusei!

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:48.680
Yusei!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:50.680
Wake up, Yusei!

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.890
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.180
This light...

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.980
Is it going to Yusei?

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.460
What's that light?

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.420
What?

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.700
Yusei...

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.030
Yusei.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:31.750
Who is it?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.680
Yusei, it's me.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:36.840
Father!

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:46.040
Father.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.360
Did I lose?

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.290
No, the duel isn't over yet.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.120
It's impossible.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.760
I can no longer move.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.200
Don't give up, Yusei.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.000
You can do it.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.020
Stop saying whatever you want.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:12.120
I battled with all my strength, 
but this time, it's impossible.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.410
I can no longer battle.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.000
Yusei.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:26.360
Yusei, there's still something you must do.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.800
Just like how the Yusei Particle 
 ties other particles together,

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.920
you guide and unite people's hearts.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.960
After that, you will definitely 
reach a new stage.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:44.030
Guide and unite people's hearts.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.810
Yes, that is your duty.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:52.250
Father, you're strict.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.700
I've come to my senses, Father.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.750
I have to return to my friends.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.800
I must battle and never 
give up until the end.

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:05.080
That's why you're my son.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:08.550
Believe in the future and 
live strong, Yusei.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.230
This was the last thing
I could do for you.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.630
Father?

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:15.310
I will always be by your side.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.220
Yusei.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.130
My father saved me.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.530
Thank you, Father.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.130
I believe in the future!

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.400
I'll live strong for my father!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.250
Yusei Fudo is back!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.220
I'm deeply moved emotionally!

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:07.080
I knew he would come back!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.560
Hooray!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:09.390
Do your best!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:10.950
All right!

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.730
You're okay, Yusei!

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:14.030
That's right.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:17.690
No matter the situation, Yusei 
always created his own future.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:18.960
Yeah!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.080
Yusei!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.400
Go!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.100
Z-one, the battle isn't over yet!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.780
I promise to save 
this city and the future!

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.580
I summon the Tuner Monster Turbo Synchron!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:41.820
Level 1 Turbo Synchron tunes 
Level 7 Power Tool Dragon!

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:43.760
The mark!

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:44.840
All right!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:48.490
Yusei, use my Signer power!

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:53.850
In order to protect peace in the world, 
courage and power have a revolution!

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:00.870
Synchro Summon!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.710
Evolve, Life Stream Dragon!

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.730
When Life Stream Dragon 
is successfully summoned,

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.190
if I have less than 2000 life points,
my life points become 2000!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:21.160
All right!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.160
His life points have 
been instantly restored!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:24.960
It's pointless.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:28.680
It is destined that this city 
will perish along with Moment.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:31.560
It will be the foundation 
for a bright future.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:38.490
Is the future you're talking 
about really bright?

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:40.670
Even if Moment vanishes from history,

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:45.180
if humanity's evolution leads 
to desire and temptation,

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.970
there's no difference from 
the future you lived in!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.590
Can you still say that the world is saved?

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.680
In order to truly save the future,

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.280
everyone's hearts must move 
in the correct direction,

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:00.230
and we must create a future where we 
can flourish together with Moment!

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:04.480
If we don't save the present, then 
the future won't be saved either!

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.570
Isn't that right, Z-one?

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:12.540
I will find a new way 
to save the future!

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:17.850
Guide and unite people's hearts.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.550
Father, everyone, give me your power.

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:27.760
Yusei!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.720
Yusei!

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:30.300
Yusei!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.690
Yusei!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.610
Yusei!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:34.870
Yusei!

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:39.290
Yusei, do your best!
Don't lose!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.520
I can hear everyone's voices.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.350
I'm not carrying the burden of destiny alone.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.810
Everyone in the city is rooting for me.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.660
They are giving me power.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.050
I see!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:06.090
In order to surpass my own limits, 
I can't do it with just my own power!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:10.230
I must unite my friends' 
thoughts and form our bond.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:16.040
The bond between Team 5D's 
makes that possible!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:25.550
Yusei, you should be able to 
find your own Accel Synchro.

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:28.830
Bruno, I found it!

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:46.270
I activate Speed Spell - 
Synchro Panic from my hand!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:50.350
When I have 7 or more Speed Counters,

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:54.000
I can Special Summon as many 
Synchro Monsters as possible

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.290
that I Synchro Summoned 
earlier during this duel!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.640
But the monsters that I Special Summon
have their effects negated,

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.220
and their attack points become 0!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.690
What are you planning to do?

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.850
Come back to me!

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.760
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.710
Black Rose Dragon!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.720
Black-Winged Dragon!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.900
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:28.320
I activate Life Stream 
Dragon's effect!

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:33.850
Once per turn, I can change the Level of 
all other Synchro Monsters on my field

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:35.530
to whatever number I want!

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.800
I change Ancient Fairy 
Dragon, Black Rose Dragon,

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:44.330
Black-Winged Dragon and Red Dragon 
Archfiend's Levels to 1!

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:49.060
Jack, Crow, Aki, Luca, Lua!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.220
In order to save the future, 
we must unite our bond!

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:54.340
What's this?

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.010
What's going on?

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:59.200
Yusei wants our power.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.340
Yusei!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.120
This is the new stage!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.260
Over Top Clear Mind!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:40.680
Level 8 Life Stream Dragon tunes 
Level 1 Ancient Fairy Dragon,

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:47.250
Black Rose Dragon, Black-Winged 
Dragon and Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:54.140
When the stars unite into one,
a new bond shines on the future!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.750
Become the path that lights the way!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.860
Limit Over Accel Synchro!

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:04.400
The evolution of light!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.630
Shooting Quasar Dragon!

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:42.710
Z-one, this is the crystallization 
of Team 5D's bond!

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.320
This symbolizes our evolution!

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:11.060
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:16.440
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:21.810
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:24.580
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:29.780
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:36.390
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:43.500
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.530
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:54.710
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:54.710 --> 00:23:03.010
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:08.920
We will draw it forever
